    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_m_i_bundle_operand_iterator_base" kindref="compound">MIBundleOperandIteratorBase</ref> - Iterator that visits all operands in a bundle of MachineInstrs. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class is not intended to be used directly, use one of the sub-classes instead.</para>
<para>Intended use:</para>
<para>for (<ref refid="classllvm_1_1_m_i_bundle_operands" kindref="compound">MIBundleOperands</ref> MIO(MI); MIO.isValid(); ++MIO) { if (!MIO-&gt;<ref refid="_mips_inst_printer_8cpp_1a85e8dc708ae90b1129b892cb8ae1500f" kindref="member">isReg()</ref>) continue; ... } </para>
    </detaileddescription>
